  "referenceNumber": "RUS2403",
  "remarks": "\nIvan Alekseevich GAYCHENYA is an involved person within the meaning of the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 in that he is obtaining a benefit from or supporting the Government of Russia by working as a director of an entity that is (1) carrying on business as a Government of Russia-affiliated entity and (2) carrying on business in a sector of strategic significance to the Government of Russia, namely the Russian defence sector.\n",
